      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Remember the Temple of Purification?\r\nThere's a door behind it that leads to Zandora.\r\nThis is the key to that door.",
        "Jp" : "《禊の神殿》は覚えているか？\r\nあの奥に、ザンドラ方面へ抜ける扉がある\r\nこれはその扉の鍵だ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 163230,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I want you to go through there to\r\n[Zoma Village] in eastern Zandora.\r\nIt's a remote village far from this temple.",
        "Jp" : "そこを通って、東部ザンドラにある\r\n《ゾマ村》へ行ってほしい\r\nこの神殿から遠く離れた辺境の村だ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 163231,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So, you're going to visit the Area Master\r\nof Eastern Zandora, a woman named Nadia.",
        "Jp" : "そこで、ザンドラ東部のエリアマスターである\r\nナディアという女性を訪ねるんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 384481,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I'm sure she'd be familiar with the travelers\r\nand happenings in the area.",
        "Jp" : "彼女なら、あの地域を訪れる旅人や\r\n出来ごとに詳しいはずだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 384482,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I talked to Iris in the Ark--\r\nand told her to lay low there for a while.",
        "Jp" : "アークの中でイリスと話して――\r\nしばらくそこに身を隠せと言っておいた"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 163232,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "However, as you know,\r\nIris is still in that terrible state. \r\nI'm worried about whether she has made it.",
        "Jp" : "だが、知っての通り、イリスはあの状態だ\r\nたどり着けたかどうか心配でな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 254624,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I apologize, but could you see how she's doing? \r\nAlso, please convey my message to Iris.",
        "Jp" : "すまないが、様子を見てきてくれないか？\r\nそして、イリスに伝えてくれ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 163233,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "\"Your life is at risk,\r\nconceal yourself until I arrive.\"\r\nGiven this situation, it's no wonder\r\na hunting party might be dispatched.",
        "Jp" : "「俺が行くまで命がけで身を隠せ」とな\r\nこの状況だ――討伐隊が派遣されても\r\n不思議ではない"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 163246,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 5,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Leo",
      "Jp" : "レオ"
    }
