      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 17,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "At the very least, if we destroy the Ark, \r\nwe can put a stop to the enemy's plans.\r\nHowever, if I were Diamantes, I would keep\r\nrepeating the same thing over and over.",
        "Jp" : "少なくとも、アークを破壊してしまえば\r\n敵の計画を止めることができる\r\nでも――僕がディアマンテスなら何度でも\r\n同じ事を繰り返すと思うし――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 164794,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 18,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So then――hmm――this is quite the dilemma. \r\nFor now, I will follow Leo's judgment.",
        "Jp" : "だから――うーん――悩ましいな\r\nとりあえずレオの判断に従うよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 254625,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
